  "replacement_notes": "Within-family substitutions (e.g. UC3842<->UC3843) change UVLO behavior — a 43 in a 42 socket may not start from the bulk cap. 44/45 force 50% duty (for push-pull); using a 42 in a 44 socket allows 100% duty which may saturate the transformer.",
